OL,3,GNEWSARubber duck race doubles charity's
OL,4,Atakings
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,000 rubber ducks have been
OL,7,Fraced to raise money for charity.
OL,9,FThe 2,300 toys were dropped into Tees
OL,10,FBarrage International White Water
OL,11,FCourse for Stockton-on-Tees Round
OL,12,FTable's duck race to raise funds for
OL,13,Fthe mental health charity Teesside Mind
OL,14,Fand Great North Air Ambulance Service.
OL,16,FRace organisers said the event had
OL,17,Fgenerated #10,000 so far, double their
OL,18,Ftakings from last year.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
